    "v_2c5841ec9d341753_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 441.806939,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "您知道中国历史上最像世外桃源的古村落都有哪些吗？上集，咱们聊了红村西地诸葛村茶记和云端上的郭亮村。这集直接揭开谜底，看看前五名超凡脱俗到什么程度。尤其是排在榜首的那座终极桃园，藏在冰川与大森林的怀抱里，把那种与世隔绝的安静过成了神仙吧安的日子。老规矩，开讲之前，劳烦您扣个一点个红心，让我看看都是谁在听。第五名，塔川村安徽一县离红村不远，是一个藏在山里的小村子。别的地方好看，靠老房子，塔川靠的是一座山，它被人叫做塔川秋色。每到深秋，满山的巫棵枫树，青松一起变色，红的像火黄的，像金绿的，还没退一层压一层，把白墙黑瓦的小村整个拖在一片彩色的山林里。这满山的颜色不是天生的，村里的老人一代代传下规矩，水口山林里的树一颗也不许乱砍，守了几百年，才守住今天这一整面秋色。每年秋天，摄影师天不亮就扛着相机蹲在山坡上等光。您说这算不算祖宗种树后人？看画第四名，黄岭村，江西婺源婺源被叫做中国最美的乡村黄岭，又是婺源里最有画面感的一个。他始建于明代五百多年了，一排排灰派老房子沿着陡峭的山坡一层压一层，下面是梯田，四周是山谷，云雾一来，整个村子像挂在半空。它最出名的是晒丘，山里没有平地，家家户户只能把收下来的辣椒、玉米、南瓜、稻谷搬上屋顶，摆在木架子上，红的、黄的、橙的一圈一圈挂在白墙黑瓦之间，成了全国最出名的乡村画面。一个因为缺地才出现的土办法，晒成了最美的风景，您说这是不是生活本身的诗意？第三名，丹巴藏寨，四川甘孜，它不是一个村，而是一大片藏在高山河谷里的嘉戎藏族村寨山坡上。白墙红边的藏房散落在绿树间，一座座石头垒起的碉楼，高的能用有几十米直直插向天空，背后是终年不化的雪山。丹巴被叫做铅雕之国碉楼，多到数不清，至今还立着几百座，有的已经立了好几百年。这些碉楼没有钢筋，没有水泥，全靠一块块石头一层层垒起来。当年是为了防御，如今成了雪山下最壮观的一道风景。您站在山腰往下看，河谷森林碉楼、雪山一个镜头就装得下。您说这是不是真正的逆境？第二名，和睦村，新疆阿勒泰。他在新疆最北边的山里，离喀纳斯六十来公里，住在这里的是图瓦人，全国只有两千多人，相传是成吉思汗西征大军的后代。村里的房子清一色是原木垒起来的木屋，一根压一根凿草，咬合屋顶盖的厚厚的雪和睦河。从村子中间穿过，四周是白桦林和雪山，天一亮，晨雾裹着炊烟慢慢升起来，整个村子像浮在云里，冬天来的漫长，村里人踩着雪去放牧，一代代都是这样过日子。别人是造了一座村，和睦，是把整个村子种进了森林和雪山里。这样的画面，您说这是不是一眼就让人想住下来？第一名雨崩村，云南迪庆为什么是他？因为他不靠老房子取胜，他靠的是一个字远。他藏在梅里雪山脚下，海拔三千米上下分上羽崩夏雨崩，两个小村加起来，不过几十户人家很长一段时间里通往他的只有一条路。从西当村出发，十几公里山路翻过三千七百米左右的垭口，走上大半天。运货的是罗马，赶路的靠两条腿进了村，一抬头就是梅里雪山的主峰。卡瓦格伯海拔六千七百四十米，是藏族人心里的神山。到今天没有人登顶。村后有森林，有峡谷，有终年不断的神谱处，有冰湖村民每天的日子就是放牛、种地、看雪山，没有喇叭，没有堵车，没有人催您。前面九个村离的是老房子，比的是山水好看，可雨崩比的是离离城市，有多远离喧闹，有多远离烦恼有多远？坐在木门槛上，看着雪山所有的烦躁和委屈，瞬间烟消云散，心中出现一个念头，真想住下来。十座古村讲完了，洪村把一头牛养成画西帝，把老时光留到今天。诸葛村邻里清和常志慧茶记老桥伴着流水声，郭亮在云端守着石头房。塔窗，红叶配着热茶，黄岭在向阳坡上晒出丰收锦绣单。八、碉楼望着高雪山和睦，把木屋种进森林里，可只有于崩村在圣洁雪山的怀抱里，给疲惫的人安顿的一个真正的家。什么叫世外桃源？不是躲在深山不吃人间烟火，而是有一方天地能让您推开门，看见好山水，关上门，过上安稳，日子，心里头踏实，不慌不忙。最后问您一句，这十个村子您去过哪几个？哪一个最让您想住下来，想听更多这类故事，点个关注，咱们下期接着聊。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00001",
      "start_ms": 330,
      "end_ms": 5550,
      "text": "您知道中国历史上最像世外桃源的古村落都有哪些吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00002",
      "start_ms": 5910,
      "end_ms": 6450,
      "text": "上集，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00003",
      "start_ms": 6530,
      "end_ms": 12250,
      "text": "咱们聊了红村西地诸葛村茶记和云端上的郭亮村。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00004",
      "start_ms": 12930,
      "end_ms": 14650,
      "text": "这集直接揭开谜底，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00005",
      "start_ms": 15010,
      "end_ms": 17930,
      "text": "看看前五名超凡脱俗到什么程度。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00006",
      "start_ms": 18290,
      "end_ms": 21470,
      "text": "尤其是排在榜首的那座终极桃园，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00007",
      "start_ms": 22270,
      "end_ms": 24990,
      "text": "藏在冰川与大森林的怀抱里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00008",
      "start_ms": 25390,
      "end_ms": 30780,
      "text": "把那种与世隔绝的安静过成了神仙吧安的日子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00009",
      "start_ms": 31120,
      "end_ms": 31720,
      "text": "老规矩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00010",
      "start_ms": 32080,
      "end_ms": 32900,
      "text": "开讲之前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00011",
      "start_ms": 32900,
      "end_ms": 35140,
      "text": "劳烦您扣个一点个红心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00012",
      "start_ms": 35580,
      "end_ms": 37580,
      "text": "让我看看都是谁在听。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00013",
      "start_ms": 37940,
      "end_ms": 38600,
      "text": "第五名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00014",
      "start_ms": 38980,
      "end_ms": 42980,
      "text": "塔川村安徽一县离红村不远，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00015",
      "start_ms": 43560,
      "end_ms": 45900,
      "text": "是一个藏在山里的小村子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00016",
      "start_ms": 46740,
      "end_ms": 47880,
      "text": "别的地方好看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00017",
      "start_ms": 47940,
      "end_ms": 48780,
      "text": "靠老房子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00018",
      "start_ms": 49160,
      "end_ms": 50820,
      "text": "塔川靠的是一座山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00019",
      "start_ms": 51240,
      "end_ms": 53440,
      "text": "它被人叫做塔川秋色。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00020",
      "start_ms": 54140,
      "end_ms": 55120,
      "text": "每到深秋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00021",
      "start_ms": 55360,
      "end_ms": 57580,
      "text": "满山的巫棵枫树，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00022",
      "start_ms": 57940,
      "end_ms": 59645,
      "text": "青松一起变色，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00023",
      "start_ms": 60160,
      "end_ms": 61890,
      "text": "红的像火黄的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00024",
      "start_ms": 61890,
      "end_ms": 63090,
      "text": "像金绿的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00025",
      "start_ms": 63090,
      "end_ms": 65505,
      "text": "还没退一层压一层，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00026",
      "start_ms": 66110,
      "end_ms": 71565,
      "text": "把白墙黑瓦的小村整个拖在一片彩色的山林里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00027",
      "start_ms": 72330,
      "end_ms": 75185,
      "text": "这满山的颜色不是天生的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00028",
      "start_ms": 75670,
      "end_ms": 78355,
      "text": "村里的老人一代代传下规矩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00029",
      "start_ms": 78940,
      "end_ms": 82725,
      "text": "水口山林里的树一颗也不许乱砍，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00030",
      "start_ms": 83410,
      "end_ms": 84595,
      "text": "守了几百年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00031",
      "start_ms": 85030,
      "end_ms": 87565,
      "text": "才守住今天这一整面秋色。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00032",
      "start_ms": 88410,
      "end_ms": 89485,
      "text": "每年秋天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00033",
      "start_ms": 89940,
      "end_ms": 94425,
      "text": "摄影师天不亮就扛着相机蹲在山坡上等光。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00034",
      "start_ms": 94860,
      "end_ms": 98440,
      "text": "您说这算不算祖宗种树后人？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00035",
      "start_ms": 98460,
      "end_ms": 100065,
      "text": "看画第四名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00036",
      "start_ms": 100690,
      "end_ms": 101665,
      "text": "黄岭村，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00037",
      "start_ms": 102200,
      "end_ms": 108220,
      "text": "江西婺源婺源被叫做中国最美的乡村黄岭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00038",
      "start_ms": 108320,
      "end_ms": 111125,
      "text": "又是婺源里最有画面感的一个。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00039",
      "start_ms": 111670,
      "end_ms": 114175,
      "text": "他始建于明代五百多年了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00040",
      "start_ms": 114670,
      "end_ms": 119595,
      "text": "一排排灰派老房子沿着陡峭的山坡一层压一层，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00041",
      "start_ms": 120420,
      "end_ms": 121600,
      "text": "下面是梯田，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00042",
      "start_ms": 122240,
      "end_ms": 123400,
      "text": "四周是山谷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00043",
      "start_ms": 123840,
      "end_ms": 124840,
      "text": "云雾一来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00044",
      "start_ms": 125240,
      "end_ms": 127420,
      "text": "整个村子像挂在半空。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00045",
      "start_ms": 127820,
      "end_ms": 130220,
      "text": "它最出名的是晒丘，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00046",
      "start_ms": 130560,
      "end_ms": 131960,
      "text": "山里没有平地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00047",
      "start_ms": 132540,
      "end_ms": 139560,
      "text": "家家户户只能把收下来的辣椒、玉米、南瓜、稻谷搬上屋顶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00048",
      "start_ms": 140300,
      "end_ms": 141600,
      "text": "摆在木架子上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00049",
      "start_ms": 142080,
      "end_ms": 147640,
      "text": "红的、黄的、橙的一圈一圈挂在白墙黑瓦之间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00050",
      "start_ms": 148000,
      "end_ms": 151070,
      "text": "成了全国最出名的乡村画面。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00051",
      "start_ms": 151710,
      "end_ms": 154250,
      "text": "一个因为缺地才出现的土办法，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00052",
      "start_ms": 154610,
      "end_ms": 156410,
      "text": "晒成了最美的风景，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00053",
      "start_ms": 156670,
      "end_ms": 159570,
      "text": "您说这是不是生活本身的诗意？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00054",
      "start_ms": 159930,
      "end_ms": 160590,
      "text": "第三名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00055",
      "start_ms": 161030,
      "end_ms": 162150,
      "text": "丹巴藏寨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00056",
      "start_ms": 162570,
      "end_ms": 163710,
      "text": "四川甘孜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00057",
      "start_ms": 164130,
      "end_ms": 165190,
      "text": "它不是一个村，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00058",
      "start_ms": 165570,
      "end_ms": 172090,
      "text": "而是一大片藏在高山河谷里的嘉戎藏族村寨山坡上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00059",
      "start_ms": 172470,
      "end_ms": 175850,
      "text": "白墙红边的藏房散落在绿树间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00060",
      "start_ms": 176690,
      "end_ms": 178730,
      "text": "一座座石头垒起的碉楼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00061",
      "start_ms": 179350,
      "end_ms": 182715,
      "text": "高的能用有几十米直直插向天空，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00062",
      "start_ms": 183670,
      "end_ms": 186325,
      "text": "背后是终年不化的雪山。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00063",
      "start_ms": 186720,
      "end_ms": 190260,
      "text": "丹巴被叫做铅雕之国碉楼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00064",
      "start_ms": 190300,
      "end_ms": 191395,
      "text": "多到数不清，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00065",
      "start_ms": 191920,
      "end_ms": 193755,
      "text": "至今还立着几百座，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00066",
      "start_ms": 194280,
      "end_ms": 196245,
      "text": "有的已经立了好几百年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00067",
      "start_ms": 196640,
      "end_ms": 198215,
      "text": "这些碉楼没有钢筋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00068",
      "start_ms": 198550,
      "end_ms": 199485,
      "text": "没有水泥，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00069",
      "start_ms": 200020,
      "end_ms": 203335,
      "text": "全靠一块块石头一层层垒起来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00070",
      "start_ms": 203970,
      "end_ms": 205365,
      "text": "当年是为了防御，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00071",
      "start_ms": 205990,
      "end_ms": 209555,
      "text": "如今成了雪山下最壮观的一道风景。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00072",
      "start_ms": 209990,
      "end_ms": 212195,
      "text": "您站在山腰往下看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00073",
      "start_ms": 212980,
      "end_ms": 219685,
      "text": "河谷森林碉楼、雪山一个镜头就装得下。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00074",
      "start_ms": 220150,
      "end_ms": 222635,
      "text": "您说这是不是真正的逆境？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00075",
      "start_ms": 223020,
      "end_ms": 223785,
      "text": "第二名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00076",
      "start_ms": 224210,
      "end_ms": 224810,
      "text": "和睦村，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00077",
      "start_ms": 225170,
      "end_ms": 226325,
      "text": "新疆阿勒泰。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00078",
      "start_ms": 226890,
      "end_ms": 229315,
      "text": "他在新疆最北边的山里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00079",
      "start_ms": 229650,
      "end_ms": 231635,
      "text": "离喀纳斯六十来公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00080",
      "start_ms": 232170,
      "end_ms": 233865,
      "text": "住在这里的是图瓦人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00081",
      "start_ms": 234480,
      "end_ms": 236175,
      "text": "全国只有两千多人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00082",
      "start_ms": 236710,
      "end_ms": 239835,
      "text": "相传是成吉思汗西征大军的后代。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00083",
      "start_ms": 240220,
      "end_ms": 243525,
      "text": "村里的房子清一色是原木垒起来的木屋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00084",
      "start_ms": 244220,
      "end_ms": 246120,
      "text": "一根压一根凿草，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00085",
      "start_ms": 246140,
      "end_ms": 250250,
      "text": "咬合屋顶盖的厚厚的雪和睦河。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00086",
      "start_ms": 250250,
      "end_ms": 252010,
      "text": "从村子中间穿过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00087",
      "start_ms": 252330,
      "end_ms": 254365,
      "text": "四周是白桦林和雪山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00088",
      "start_ms": 255010,
      "end_ms": 255715,
      "text": "天一亮，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00089",
      "start_ms": 256070,
      "end_ms": 258485,
      "text": "晨雾裹着炊烟慢慢升起来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00090",
      "start_ms": 258910,
      "end_ms": 261105,
      "text": "整个村子像浮在云里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00091",
      "start_ms": 261520,
      "end_ms": 262985,
      "text": "冬天来的漫长，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00092",
      "start_ms": 263730,
      "end_ms": 265895,
      "text": "村里人踩着雪去放牧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00093",
      "start_ms": 266650,
      "end_ms": 268585,
      "text": "一代代都是这样过日子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00094",
      "start_ms": 269360,
      "end_ms": 271085,
      "text": "别人是造了一座村，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00095",
      "start_ms": 271630,
      "end_ms": 272150,
      "text": "和睦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00096",
      "start_ms": 272150,
      "end_ms": 276385,
      "text": "是把整个村子种进了森林和雪山里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00097",
      "start_ms": 276890,
      "end_ms": 277975,
      "text": "这样的画面，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00098",
      "start_ms": 278300,
      "end_ms": 281825,
      "text": "您说这是不是一眼就让人想住下来？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00099",
      "start_ms": 282170,
      "end_ms": 283915,
      "text": "第一名雨崩村，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00100",
      "start_ms": 284290,
      "end_ms": 286985,
      "text": "云南迪庆为什么是他？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00101",
      "start_ms": 287400,
      "end_ms": 289445,
      "text": "因为他不靠老房子取胜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00102",
      "start_ms": 290110,
      "end_ms": 292395,
      "text": "他靠的是一个字远。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00103",
      "start_ms": 292920,
      "end_ms": 295325,
      "text": "他藏在梅里雪山脚下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00104",
      "start_ms": 295770,
      "end_ms": 300160,
      "text": "海拔三千米上下分上羽崩夏雨崩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00105",
      "start_ms": 300340,
      "end_ms": 302020,
      "text": "两个小村加起来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00106",
      "start_ms": 302020,
      "end_ms": 307175,
      "text": "不过几十户人家很长一段时间里通往他的只有一条路。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00107",
      "start_ms": 307840,
      "end_ms": 309260,
      "text": "从西当村出发，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00108",
      "start_ms": 309620,
      "end_ms": 313640,
      "text": "十几公里山路翻过三千七百米左右的垭口，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00109",
      "start_ms": 314280,
      "end_ms": 315360,
      "text": "走上大半天。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00110",
      "start_ms": 315880,
      "end_ms": 317280,
      "text": "运货的是罗马，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00111",
      "start_ms": 317680,
      "end_ms": 320520,
      "text": "赶路的靠两条腿进了村，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00112",
      "start_ms": 320940,
      "end_ms": 323980,
      "text": "一抬头就是梅里雪山的主峰。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00113",
      "start_ms": 324160,
      "end_ms": 327460,
      "text": "卡瓦格伯海拔六千七百四十米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00114",
      "start_ms": 327720,
      "end_ms": 329780,
      "text": "是藏族人心里的神山。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00115",
      "start_ms": 330340,
      "end_ms": 331940,
      "text": "到今天没有人登顶。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00116",
      "start_ms": 332320,
      "end_ms": 333740,
      "text": "村后有森林，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00117",
      "start_ms": 334280,
      "end_ms": 335120,
      "text": "有峡谷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00118",
      "start_ms": 335600,
      "end_ms": 337850,
      "text": "有终年不断的神谱处，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00119",
      "start_ms": 338050,
      "end_ms": 345270,
      "text": "有冰湖村民每天的日子就是放牛、种地、看雪山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00120",
      "start_ms": 345710,
      "end_ms": 346650,
      "text": "没有喇叭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00121",
      "start_ms": 346990,
      "end_ms": 347890,
      "text": "没有堵车，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00122",
      "start_ms": 348390,
      "end_ms": 349570,
      "text": "没有人催您。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00123",
      "start_ms": 349990,
      "end_ms": 352690,
      "text": "前面九个村离的是老房子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00124",
      "start_ms": 353010,
      "end_ms": 354470,
      "text": "比的是山水好看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00125",
      "start_ms": 354890,
      "end_ms": 358630,
      "text": "可雨崩比的是离离城市，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00126",
      "start_ms": 358630,
      "end_ms": 360350,
      "text": "有多远离喧闹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00127",
      "start_ms": 360370,
      "end_ms": 362670,
      "text": "有多远离烦恼有多远？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00128",
      "start_ms": 362990,
      "end_ms": 364290,
      "text": "坐在木门槛上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00129",
      "start_ms": 364890,
      "end_ms": 368840,
      "text": "看着雪山所有的烦躁和委屈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00130",
      "start_ms": 369080,
      "end_ms": 371045,
      "text": "瞬间烟消云散，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00131",
      "start_ms": 371600,
      "end_ms": 373205,
      "text": "心中出现一个念头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00132",
      "start_ms": 373800,
      "end_ms": 374855,
      "text": "真想住下来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00133",
      "start_ms": 375360,
      "end_ms": 376885,
      "text": "十座古村讲完了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00134",
      "start_ms": 377650,
      "end_ms": 381290,
      "text": "洪村把一头牛养成画西帝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00135",
      "start_ms": 381290,
      "end_ms": 383385,
      "text": "把老时光留到今天。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00136",
      "start_ms": 384060,
      "end_ms": 389305,
      "text": "诸葛村邻里清和常志慧茶记老桥伴着流水声，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00137",
      "start_ms": 390150,
      "end_ms": 392535,
      "text": "郭亮在云端守着石头房。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00138",
      "start_ms": 393290,
      "end_ms": 393770,
      "text": "塔窗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00139",
      "start_ms": 393770,
      "end_ms": 395385,
      "text": "红叶配着热茶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00140",
      "start_ms": 396020,
      "end_ms": 400570,
      "text": "黄岭在向阳坡上晒出丰收锦绣单。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00141",
      "start_ms": 400590,
      "end_ms": 404030,
      "text": "八、碉楼望着高雪山和睦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00142",
      "start_ms": 404090,
      "end_ms": 405975,
      "text": "把木屋种进森林里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00143",
      "start_ms": 406570,
      "end_ms": 410525,
      "text": "可只有于崩村在圣洁雪山的怀抱里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00144",
      "start_ms": 410960,
      "end_ms": 414285,
      "text": "给疲惫的人安顿的一个真正的家。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00145",
      "start_ms": 414720,
      "end_ms": 416235,
      "text": "什么叫世外桃源？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00146",
      "start_ms": 416650,
      "end_ms": 419265,
      "text": "不是躲在深山不吃人间烟火，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00147",
      "start_ms": 419680,
      "end_ms": 422960,
      "text": "而是有一方天地能让您推开门，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00148",
      "start_ms": 423060,
      "end_ms": 424225,
      "text": "看见好山水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00149",
      "start_ms": 424640,
      "end_ms": 425420,
      "text": "关上门，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00150",
      "start_ms": 425420,
      "end_ms": 426240,
      "text": "过上安稳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00151",
      "start_ms": 426240,
      "end_ms": 426785,
      "text": "日子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00152",
      "start_ms": 427140,
      "end_ms": 428345,
      "text": "心里头踏实，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00153",
      "start_ms": 428690,
      "end_ms": 429695,
      "text": "不慌不忙。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00154",
      "start_ms": 430090,
      "end_ms": 431085,
      "text": "最后问您一句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00155",
      "start_ms": 431440,
      "end_ms": 433775,
      "text": "这十个村子您去过哪几个？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00156",
      "start_ms": 434480,
      "end_ms": 436685,
      "text": "哪一个最让您想住下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00157",
      "start_ms": 437330,
      "end_ms": 438935,
      "text": "想听更多这类故事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00158",
      "start_ms": 439230,
      "end_ms": 439910,
      "text": "点个关注，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2c5841ec9d341753_s00159",
      "start_ms": 440050,
      "end_ms": 441505,
      "text": "咱们下期接着聊。"
    }
  ],
